# Quick Mod Assign 0.2.0 (LFO assign): with LFO held, further turns of the destination's knob set DEP as the
# same turns of stock's own DEP knob (LFO page, knob H) set it. Each path starts from DEP 0 by CC and gets the
# same nudges (each: 16 counts back, then the steps as one turn); then one more step of DEP's own knob shows
# the value, and the two values must be equal. Up first, then down. One 124-count turn each: stock's
# acceleration over several fast turns is not compared here.
# Sets and leaves the BD track's LFO at DST none, DEP 0 (by CC). Changes the BD sound's LFO in the active kit.
name: qma-lfo-depth
state: changes
ignore: 0 0 128 9, 0 55 128 9

hold TRK
key BD
release TRK
cc 105 0
cc 109 64
key FLTR
wait 3500
hold LFO
nudge E +1                          # takes FRQ at 0: sets no depth
nudge E +31
nudge E +31
wait 750
screen boxup
expect boxup == ref                 # FRQ box +1.93 across the column (DEP as the LFO page writes it)
release LFO
wait 500
key LFO
wait 3500
nudge H +1
wait 750
screen qmaup
expect qmaup == ref region 96 9 32 46
cc 109 64
nudge H +31
nudge H +31
nudge H +1
wait 750
screen stockup
expect qmaup == stockup region 96 30 32 25

cc 109 64
key FLTR
wait 3500
hold LFO
nudge E -31
nudge E -31
wait 750
screen boxdown
expect boxdown == ref               # FRQ box -1.93
release LFO
wait 500
key LFO
wait 3500
nudge H -1
wait 750
screen qmadown
expect qmadown == ref region 96 9 32 46
cc 109 64
nudge H -31
nudge H -31
nudge H -1
wait 750
screen stockdown
expect qmadown == stockdown region 96 30 32 25
cc 105 0
cc 109 64
